  "details": "The bug that happens, literally out of no where, is glitchy squares of black will appear in front of my vision. When I move my head, the squares follow my vision. The squares are black and I can't see past them or through them. They flicker and come in and out, it's almost like they're giant dead pixels. The glitch doesn't continue outside of VRChat, and I always have to restart my headset. If I just try to restart VRChat and keep my headset running, when I join back the glitch is still there.\nI encountered the bug recently on a VRChat world I've been visiting. I could be doing anything, standing in my house or talking or moving around and the blocks just show up with no prompt. No one else seems to experience this bug but me, or so it seems. \nThis bug has been happening on my Oculus Quest when I play VRChat. I really hope someone can explain why this is happening and how to fix it. Thank you.",
